&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;NuGet: &lt;a href="https://www.nuget.org/packages/OpenTelemetry.Extensions.Hosting/1.17.0" rel="nofollow"&gt;OpenTelemetry.Extensions.Hosting v1.17.0&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
